<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 25.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 25.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Telecasters Nqld     15.69     5.10</p>
<p> 2   Mt Leyshon Gold	10.96     2.28</p>
<p> 3   BT Prop Trust	   9.43     1.73</p>
<p> 4   Prime Credit Tr	 9.42     1.04</p>
<p> 5   Aust Tour		 9.38     0.80</p>
<p> 6   Indu Property	   8.96     0.96</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv	 8.92     1.13</p>
